    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "1 Elm Park is a well presented semi-detached residence, superbly located within this mature and highly sought-after development in the heart of Kildare Town.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 130 sq. m., this attractive home offers well-proportioned, light-filled accommodation with a practical layout designed for modern family living. The property further benefits from a generous, low-maintenance side & rear garden with excellent potential for future development.\r\n\r\nWhile the home retains many of its charming original features, it has been thoughtfully enhanced in recent years. Upgrades include the addition of a stylish new kitchen space, a convenient guest W.C./washroom, and a full attic conversion, providing valuable extra accommodation ideal for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nAdding to its appeal, this exceptional family home qualifies for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant, offering prospective buyers the opportunity to avail of up to €50,000 toward further upgrades or renovations making it an ideal choice for those seeking both comfort and future potential.\r\nElm Park is a mature and established development in the heart of Kildare Town, offering the rare combination of a settled residential setting with the convenience of being close to local amenities. Schools, shops, cafés, sporting facilities and transport connections (2 Min Stroll from Kildare Rail Station)  are all within easy reach, making day-to-day family life wonderfully convenient.\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE:\r\n\r\nFront driveway & garden to side. Enclosed rear garden incorporating storage shed/workshop.\r\nAmple Scope for further development subject to necessary planning permission. Successful applications in general area."
      },
